		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Merci &quot;Marc Cousin&quot;&#160; pour votre réponse.</p><p>Voici le message d&#039;erreur que j&#039;ai eu quand je lance le restore à partir de psql :</p><p>psql:/var/prog/13Octobre2009.backup:5906: invalid command \}¤Op^w,8@/eًiأُك=B(َيصخ@­~ع&#039;Gب,ٍ5ْP؛ٌ~M|uِض<br />psql:/var/prog/13Octobre2009.backup:5911: \q: extra argument &quot;َن؛&quot; ignored<br />psql:/var/prog/13Octobre2009.backup:5911: ERROR:&#160; invalid byte sequence for encoding &quot;UTF8&quot;: 0xaa<br />HINT:&#160; This error can also happen if the byte sequence does not match the encoding expected by the server, which is controlled by &quot;client_encoding&quot;.</p><p>Que dois je faire par la suite svp ?</p>]]></content>
